.od.nih.gov/factsheets/Pregnancy-HealthProfessional/"}, {"label": "CDC: Maternal Diet & Breastfeeding", "url": "https://www.cdc.gov/breastfeeding-special-circumstances/hcp/diet-micronutrients/maternal-diet.html"}, {"label": "Harvard Nutrition Source: Oats", "url": "https://nutritionsource.hsph.harvard.edu/food-features/oats/"}, {"label": "Harvard Nutrition Source: Chia Seeds", "url": "https://nutritionsource.hsph.harvard.edu/food-features/chia-seeds/"}]$few$::jsonb, null, null, null, null, $few$25 recipes.pdf$few$);
